    "description": "“We can’t just talk about the American spirit and not give our people the technology they need.” \n\nWhen it comes to nuclear power, the stakes are too high. At AIPCon 8, The Nuclear Company shares how they’re reimagining what a modern construction site can look like, pushing America’s frontline workers to the competitive edge so they can build on-time and on-budget in the safest possible way.",
