    "evidence": "Official title, description, and full captions. Cost, schedule, staffing, safety, and national-capacity figures—as well as the halving targets—are claims by Webb, not independently verified outcomes. The mission-control system is described as under development, and the potential state project award was explicitly not final at the time of the talk."
